{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"05a5d514c3f33020e4490123d9e82e7d568c99bae23821e1e13254f068b47771","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_de101c0b766fd57e9c648be4083fad69febe55ab77c81b7001e711cbac945f3a","overall_assessment":"The paper presents a compilation-based DSL for deep learning. The supplied evidence is insufficient to determine specific policy compliance regarding anonymity, plagiarism, or broader impact documentation, as no venue-specific policies or external overlap data are available. The paper does not contain a dedicated ethics or broader impact section, nor does it explicitly detail data licensing or consent for the ImageNet dataset used in experiments.","paper_id":"Bks8cPcxe","paper_identity_sha256":"b9c05b74fdcc426f7424eacf226dd31515a2592252baeab26b45477e6a665f1e","prompt_identity_sha256":"4f151c64e052e0d0b7889c02667eb33bed9eaa26c54ab6aabc480a7f14b8dd4a","raw_response_sha256":"d47c2670c041de40e8fddb66c5a96816ed98eb2146a8eb361abaeb99e10ca764","request_identity_sha256":"77bcbddacded1dac48bf8b5c513613dbcf5cb9b4ff64edab58f70a32056c5010","reviewer_identity_sha256":"32b29c26fbf1508e066dfb25b1a9a3fe0654c5869a7da3020e1e8e61940befe3","role":"POL","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"5d6612f1c336d1f01860a5b2e3d87d94b60fe0e676bdf367745925d55bdf0066","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper does not contain a dedicated section discussing ethical risks, fairness, bias, or potential harms associated with the use of DeepDSL or the deep learning models it compiles. As a systems and compilation paper, it focuses on technical performance and portability. No specific ethical mitigation strategies or discussions of dual-use concerns are visible in the provided text.","subdimension_id":"POL-ETH"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-030","SRC-031"],"review_text":"The paper states that experiments use ImageNet images resized to 224 by 224 and that DeepDSL and Caffe tests load real images from the LMDB database. It does not explicitly discuss the licensing terms of the ImageNet dataset, data consent, or privacy compliance regarding the use of this data. The paper mentions that DeepDSL programs are publicly available, but does not specify the license under which the code or data is released.","subdimension_id":"POL-DAT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-001"],"review_text":"The paper lists the authors' names (Tian Zhao, Xiao Bing Huang, Yu Cao) and their institutional affiliations (University of Wisconsin - Milwaukee, University of Massachusetts, Lowell) along with their email addresses on the first page. Without a frozen venue-specific anonymity policy for the 2017 ICLR submission, it is not possible to declare a double-blind violation, but the presence of identifying information is noted.","subdimension_id":"POL-ANO"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The supplied evidence does not include external plagiarism checks, overlap analysis, or information regarding dual submission. Therefore, it is not possible to determine whether the content is original or if there is any evidence of plagiarism or dual submission based solely on the provided paper text.","subdimension_id":"POL-PLG"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper does not include a broader impact statement, a responsible AI checklist, or explicit documentation of IRB/ethics approvals. It also does not specify the software license for the DeepDSL code, although it provides a GitHub URL. Without a frozen policy obligation requiring these specific documents for this venue and year, the absence of these items is noted as a lack of visible compliance documentation rather than a violation.","subdimension_id":"POL-IMP"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"86476ae65e48cdc8f7eef0678ed1081fccb4f478fa4f049d9430c19bd7f1ea47","paper_id":"Bks8cPcxe","paper_ordinal":62,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"d47c2670c041de40e8fddb66c5a96816ed